Package: evidenceos.utils
Title: Statistical Utilities for Evidence Synthesis and Meta-Analysis
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: c(
    person("EvidenceOS", "Team", email = "team@evidenceos.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("Mahmood", "Arai", email = "mahmood726@gmail.com", role = "ctb",
           comment = "Original author of integrated code")
)
Description: Comprehensive utilities for meta-analysis including overfitting detection,
    cross-validation methods, effect size conversions, risk of bias assessment, and
    data validation. Integrates best-practice methods from Mahmood789 repositories
    with evidence-based medicine workflows.
